DESCRIPTION:Practical tools for smarter business. Presented by Alvix Advis
 ory. Co-sponsored by M&T Bank and the North Essex Chamber of Commerce. Cut
  through the AI hype. Discover practical tools you can use tomorrow. Keep 
 people and judgement at the center. In one practical hour\, explore: • W
 hat AI can—and can’t—do for your business • How ChatGPT\, Claude\,
  and other tools differ • How to write prompts that produce useful resul
 ts • A live\, repeatable small-business marketing workflow • How to pr
 otect confidential information and use AI responsibly Drinks\, hors d'oeuv
 res & conversation. Register for this event HERE
URL:https://business.northessexchamber.com/events/details/ai-for-small-bus
 iness-one-hour-to-smarter-work
X-SOURCE:North Essex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
